  "tapes": [
    {
      "title": "Concealment Basics",
      "type": "STARTER",
      "story": false,
      "loop": false,
      "typeSpeed": 0.052,
      "transcription": "ECD Workforce Training Series\nTape 12: Concealment Basics\n\n\nFor all personnel heading topside, remember these three rules for hiding:\nFirst - Always look for spaces you can get under. The lower, the better.\nSecond - If something spots you, you need to break line of sight first before hiding again.\nThird - Once hidden, complete silence. No movement, no radio calls. Nothing.\n\n\nStay alert. Stay alive. This concludes basic concealment training.\n\n\n[Click of Recording Equipment]",
      "audio": "/game/tapes/concealment-basics.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "Door Operations",
      "type": "STARTER",
      "story": false,
      "loop": false,
      "typeSpeed": 0.059,
      "transcription": "ECD Workforce Training Series\nTape 16: Door Operations\n\n\nFor all personnel conducting surface operations, here are critical door tactics:\nFirst - Lock doors behind you. It won't stop them forever, but it'll slow them down.\nSecond - You can kick down locked doors yourself, but remember - the noise will attract anything nearby.\nThird - If something's right on you, slam a door in its face. The impact will stun it, giving you time to run.\n\n\nThis concludes door operation training.\n\n\n[Click of Recording Equipment]",
      "audio": "/game/tapes/door-operations.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "Supply Collection",
      "type": "STARTER",
      "story": false,
      "loop": false,
      "typeSpeed": 0.057,
      "transcription": "ECD Workforce Training Series\nTape 02: Supply Collection Protocol\n\n\nAll workforce teams, listen carefully to these supply run procedures:\n\n\nFirst - You have three days to gather supplies from your assigned location.\nSecond - Use the supply bin on your train to safely store anything you collect. These supplies will be lost if your entire team is killed.\nThird - If you need immediate funds, you can sell your supplies before debt payment day at a reduced rate.\nFourth - When you sell your supplies, they will be exchanged for credits.\n\n\nStay efficient. Stay alive. This concludes supply operation training.\n\n\n[Click of Recording Equipment]",
      "audio": "/game/tapes/supply-collection.ogg"
    },
